  <item>
    <title>08.关于减肥的迷思，人类苦恼至今！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642266e4179eec53318710bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642266e4179eec53318710bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Mar 2023 04:02:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于如何与减肥共处，是至今仍在困扰我（和我们（和众多人类 的一个世纪难题。虽然信奉着“肉是福气”，但木李和五子依旧没能摆脱对于减肥的迷恋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目木李和五子细数了过往短暂而辉煌（失败）的减肥经历：从健身房到“不看广告看疗效”的减肥产品，再迎来帕姐时代，开启微信减肥小组......一系列与身体“对抗”的爆笑故事，一段对于理想身材的胡言乱语，和一些与身体和平共处的自由时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>带上耳机，一起进入今天的「失职时间」！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️ 主播介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>木李（创作练习者，一个麻瓜）</span></p><span></span><p><span>五子（不工作的媒体工作者，幻想家）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟本期亮点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 木李春日减肥计划（Again）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 我爸我妈，健身房资深爱好者：低欲望减肥，高欲望社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 少儿拉丁舞，我对身体的初审视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 那些我们最想减肥的时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 失败的精神激励法：没落四小猪与疯狂帕梅拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 木李和五子加入减肥对赌群，疯狂内卷 短暂辉煌！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 代餐、塑身衣、“不看广告看疗效”的减肥产品，是“智商税”吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">38:41</a> 告别减肥迷恋，身体偶像就是我！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>火锅爽 - &nbsp;阿雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>Funky frets - David Spicer</span></p><span></span><p><span>Who Says - &nbsp;Selena Gomez</span></p><span></span><p><span>📎 节目订阅</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜网易云音乐｜喜马拉雅｜QQ音乐｜苹果播客｜Spotify｜Google Podcasts</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhjvgMinpxThefu3s-HM6nnRuZpU.m4a" length="46957739" type="audio/mp4"/>
